---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About Belinda Dunne | Auckland Boudoir Photographer"
  description="Meet Belinda Dunne, an Auckland boudoir photographer with a master's in photography focused on posing and lighting, helping women see themselves in a new light."
>
  <section class="bg-boudoir-ink py-20 text-boudoir-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl">Meet your Auckland boudoir photographer</h1>
      <a
        href="/contact-boudoir-photography-auckland"
        class="mt-8 inline-block border-2 border-boudoir-pink px-6 py-3 text-boudoir-pink hover:bg-boudoir-pink hover:text-boudoir-ink"
      >
        Contact me today
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
      <div>
        <img
          src="/images/about/belinda-portrait.jpg"
          alt="Belinda Dunne, Auckland boudoir photographer"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          width="1600"
          height="1600"
        />
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-xl italic text-boudoir-pink">
          &ldquo;I don't look good in photographs&rdquo; to &ldquo;omg is that really me&rdquo;
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6 text-boudoir-muted">
          I'm a female boudoir photographer based in Auckland, and I only take
          on one session a day so I'm never watching the clock. My master's
          in photography focused specifically on posing and lighting, the
          two things that make or break how a boudoir photo turns out.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-boudoir-muted">
          I've always been passionate about empowering women to feel
          beautiful and confident in their own skin. My journey started in
          the events industry, where I worked to improve the representation
          of female athletes in the media. But I wanted to do more &mdash; I
          wanted to help everyday women see themselves in a new light. That's
          why I turned my much-loved hobby into a career and became a
          boudoir photographer.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-boudoir-muted">
          I hear all the time: &ldquo;I never look good in photos.&rdquo; But
          here's the truth &mdash; it's not you. It's bad lighting, bad
          angles, and the ideas we've been fed about beauty for years. I've
          spent years mastering how to light and pose every body type to
          bring out what makes you magnetic. Every curve, every expression,
          every little moment &mdash; we'll capture it all. This isn't just
          photography. It's transformation.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-boudoir-muted">
          When you see your final images, you won't just see beauty. You'll
          see strength, sensuality, softness, fire &mdash; everything that
          makes you you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-boudoir-cream py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl">Ready to fall in love with yourself?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-boudoir-muted">
        If you would like a free, no-obligation consultation, I'd love you to
        get in touch.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact-boudoir-photography-auckland"
        class="mt-8 inline-block border-2 border-boudoir-pink px-6 py-3 text-boudoir-pink hover:bg-boudoir-pink hover:text-boudoir-ink"
      >
        Contact me today
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
